"DIV",{"style":"flex: 1 1 0%; overflow-y: auto; padding: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"Who we are"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"LessonNest is operated by Daniel Driscoll (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\"). We are committed to protecting your personal data in accordance with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018. Contact us at dd.driscoll92@gmail.com."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"What data we collect"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"We collect: your name and email address when you create an account; usage data including lesson plans, resources and book searches you generate; profile information you choose to provide (school name, region, year groups); your profile picture if you upload one; subscription and billing information if you upgrade to a paid plan."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"How we use your data"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"We use your data to: provide and improve the LessonNest service; personalise your experience (pre-filling year group and subject preferences); send transactional emails (account confirmation, password reset); communicate about your subscription; analyse usage patterns to improve the product. We do not sell your data to third parties or use it for advertising."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"Data storage"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"Your data is stored securely using Supabase (PostgreSQL database hosted on AWS in the EU). Profile pictures are stored in Supabase Storage. We use Anthropic's Claude API to generate lesson plans and resources — prompts and responses are not stored by Anthropic beyond their standard processing."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"Data retention"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"We retain your data for as long as you have an account. If you delete your account, all your data is permanently deleted within 30 days. You can delete your account at any time from Profile & settings → Account."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"Your rights"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"Under UK GDPR you have the right to: access your personal data; correct inaccurate data; delete your data (\"right to be forgotten\"); restrict or object to processing; data portability. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at dd.driscoll92@gmail.com."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"Cookies"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"We use only essential cookies required for authentication (session management). We do not use tracking, advertising or analytics cookies."]],["DIV",{"style":"margin-bottom: 20px;"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(44, 44, 42); margin-bottom: 6px;"},"Changes to this policy"],["P",{"style":"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); line-height: 1.7;"},"We may update this policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes by email or by a notice in the app."]]],["DIV",{"style":"padding: 12px 20px; border-top: 0.5px solid rgb(211, 209, 199); flex-shrink: 0;"},["BUTTON",{"style":"height: 36px; padding: 0px 16px; background: rgb(245, 244, 240); border: 0.5px solid rgb(211, 209, 199); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(95, 94, 90); cursor: pointer; font-family: \"DM Sans\", sans-serif;"},"Close"]]]]]],[[26,73]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":119731.952,"wallTime":1782334168146,"collectionTime":0.30000000004656613,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
